	(text "ADD-ON 2026-10-30 (all parts DNP-able, add-only: uses pins that had no connection)\nQwiic I2C3: PA8 = SCL (pin 41), PC9 = SDA (pin 40); Qwiic pinout 1 GND, 2 3V3, 3 SDA, 4 SCL. DNP R105/R106 if the breakout has its own pull-ups.\nLED strip 1: PA7 = SPI1 MOSI (pin 23) -> U101 74AHCT1G125 at 5 V -> 330R -> J105. LED strip 2: PB5 = SPI3 MOSI (pin 57, AF6) -> U102 -> 330R -> J106.\nTwo separate strips, each with its own PTC. Zephyr worldsemi,ws2812-spi x2 on DMA; do not map SPI3 SCK to a used pin. Cap total LED current ~0.3 A in firmware (5V rail budget)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 236.22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f3132ea1-304b-4a19-a359-29d1c125079a")
	)
